  -pdb PDB_FN, --pdb_fn PDB_FN
                        Protein PDB file to be annotated. (default: None)
  --cmap_csv CMAP_CSV   Catalogue with chain to file path mapping. (default:
                        None)
  --pdb_dir PDB_DIR     Directory with PDB files of predicted Rosetta/DMPFold
